WEBVTT

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.570
That's right.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.340
The week after next, we'll have interviews with some new people.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.650
Haruka, can you join in on those?

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.070
Sure!

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.970
Haruka-san, the flyers, the flyers!

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.320
Wait, I changed my mind.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.020
Hinata, would you mind?

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.730
No, that's fine.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.750
Are you saying that the interviewees will be middle schoolers?

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.230
And girls to boot?!

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:36.570
Who knows?

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.950
That's great, Kana-chan!

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.570
You're going to graduate from being a newbie.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:46.090
But, but I still can't do...

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:49.330
[Senpai=older/more experienced person]

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:49.330
Oh, so you'll finally become a senpai, too.

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:51.130
S-senpai!

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.270
Well it goes in the order you arrived here.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.530
Yup yup.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.840
But, but...

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:02.600
You'll be fine. I'm sure you'll set a great example for the new people.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.150
Yeah, just like us!

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:06.220
Yep!

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:12.750
That's weird, how come none of their ears are bleeding?

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:17.380
All right!

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:24.620
Owww...

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:33.420
Grandma, all of a sudden I'm about to become a senpai.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:39.780
The first thing I have to achieve as a senpai is to learn how to ride a bike!

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:18.880
And the first...

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.930
Oh, Kana!

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.390
You're late.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.790
Good morning,

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.950
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.570
Early to bed, early to rise.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.100
Two more laps!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.660
Okay.

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:59.940
By the way, you've been late a lot lately.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:05.500
That's true. And after class is over, you immediately rush off.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.320
What's going on?

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:10.470
Oh nothing, just a lot of stuff going on.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.740
What, did you get a boyfriend?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.970
No, of course not.

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:20.510
That's right! Stop talking nonsense!

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:24.920
Yeah right, I bet you've already set up a date to go to the amusement park.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.620
Amusement park!?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:32.360
Kana, you mustn't go to such an indecent and improper place like that!

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:35.940
Oh, Mika-chan, you don't like amusement parks?

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:40.350
And I was just thinking that I would invite you so we could all go together.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.910
Ahh...

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:46.800
Good work!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.230
Nakamachi-san, you've gotten much better.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:54.700
Your time is much better than last spring,

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.250
and it looks like your stamina has improved, too!

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:58.660
Thank you very much.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:03.090
That's because Kana works hard and runs every morning, good girl.

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:09.000
It's not just me. Mika-chan does the same, right, Mika-chan?

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:15.380
Well, I... I would go to the amusement park if you insisted...

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.810
It's a dating spot.

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:21.950
I'm off then!

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.650
Hey Kana!

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:30.580
I bet she has a date with her boyfriend.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:34.480
B-b-b-b-boyfriend!? Ambush?!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.440
I said date.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:42.460
I see. Do you think he's bringing her to school on his bike every day?

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.850
What did you say!?

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.990
That's no good.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.080
When two people ride on a bike,

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:55.040
the police will arrest you and sentence you to death...

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.460
<b>And...</b>

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:02.260
I still can't get it right.

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:06.130
I wonder how I can learn to ride my bike well.

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.900
M-Mika-chan?

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:33.570
Mika-chan?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:38.100
Kana! This is just...

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:42.300
Yes, I understand that there are days like these.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.610
Hey! Don't read into it!

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:47.740
Don't worry, I won't tell anybody.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.970
I will carefully lock this away in my heart,

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:55.620
and take it out sometimes to look at it.

00:06:53.910 --> 00:07:00.540
Hehe hehe hehe

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:58.390
Yes... intently...

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.610
Just forget it already!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:01.850
Kanamemo, Kanamika

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.230
What, practicing to ride your bike?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:08.230
That's right, I've been practicing by using that thing.

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.660
How about it?

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:18.550
I wouldn't even mind bringing you to and from school on my bike starting today!

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:21.130
Mika-chan, didn't you know?

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:25.850
When two people ride on a bike, the police will yell at you.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:34.950
I know that. I didn't want to ride my bike with you anyway... with you....

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:41.530
Um, how about this then? 
Next time we can ride to school with two bikes.

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:44.850
Oh, we could do that!

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:49.480
By the way Mika-chan, have you learned how to ride a bike?

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:55.420
I did! I can now go anywhere like the wind!

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:57.980
Wow, that's amazing!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.430
In my heart!

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:01.970
Huh?

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.490
I'm so good that you won't even be able to reach me!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:11.040
In my heart, I'm also a famous super cyclist!

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.120
What?!

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:17.430
All right, then let's see who can ride their bike better!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.950
A match! All right, bring it on!

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.910
Oh, but how do we do it?

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.350
That's easy!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.340
We have those at our disposal!

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:28.840
No way.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.230
What?!

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:32.290
Kana, are you running away?!

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:36.470
No, I mean those are for little kids,

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:39.120
so getting on one is too embarrassing.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:44.730
I see, I guess that's that.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:50.310
If it was that much fun, you can get on one by yourself.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.260
You imbecile!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.790
Paycut, paycut!

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:59.190
Then how about we pretend we're on a bike and do it like this?

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:01.230
All right, fine by me.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.030
Then,

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:07.140
I'd like to begin the match.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.520
Ready when you are!

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:13.390
Are you okay with the route from the school gate to this park?

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:14.390
Yes.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.520
Then let's do it. Ready...

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.870
Mama, what are they doing?

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.050
Don't look!

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.310
Go!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:29.400
Shifting gears!

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:31.750
Me too!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.990
Oh, there's an intersection up ahead.

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:37.080
I'm not going to lose!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.160
I'm going to fly over it!

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.670
Mika-chan, minus one point.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.360
What? Why?!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:52.060
You have to come to a stop at an intersection.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.870
Okay, let's continue.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.070
All right...

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:10.340
Oh, a truck just shot out onto the street in front of us!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:11.350
Slam.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.020
I was hit by it.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:19.290
What!?

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:23.920
Kana!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:30.320
Mi-Mika-chan, this is it for me...

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:34.000
Hang in there, your wounds are not serious!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:37.500
When you see Johnny,

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:40.870
please tell him...

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:43.270
Johnny?!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:46.250
Johnny

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.000
Kana!

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:54.970
That I'm sorry for being such an incompetent

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:59.690
wo... ma... n...

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:05.500
Kana!

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:12.280
Oh, it's so late already.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:15.480
Mika-chan, I am going to go home now.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.940
Damn you, Johnny!

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:37.410
Grandma, today I somehow ended up

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:44.840
"practicing by pretending to be on your bike" in the park.

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:47.550
It was a lot of fun.

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:49.290
All right.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:56.610
I'm already at the end.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:03.860
I'll have to go buy a new one tomorrow.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:31.800
I'll be fine.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:31.800
[V for victory]

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:48.100
Oh, it's already 10! I have to go to bed!

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:05.130
There are so many different kinds!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:16.990
This one's cute! Where's the price?

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:23.000
2980 Yen?!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:27.880
Maybe it comes with a treasure map.

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:28.050
It's here.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:29.220
No, it doesn't.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.510
Hello, is someone in there?

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:36.950
Nope.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:41.130
I guess I have to give up.

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:43.300
Kana-chan!

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:47.750
Yume-san, are you on your way back from your school?

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:48.780
Yup.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:55.770
Oh that one's cute. Are you going to buy it?

00:13:55.770 --> 00:14:00.890
Of course not! I can't buy something this extravagant!

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:04.620
Well since I'm here, why don't I just buy it for you then?

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.610
No, you mustn't!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:11.200
But you want that diary, right?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.320
Well I do,

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:18.930
but I can't just accept it without a reason...

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:22.250
A reason, huh?

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:25.000
You mean something like the ulterior motives

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.360
of a middle aged man who gives presents to cute, young girls?

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.130
How about that?

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.750
Please don't say stuff Haruka-san would say.

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:43.370
Damn that Kana. I bet that's a present for that Johnny guy.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:53.030
But I really wanted that diary; it was so cute.

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:56.630
I want you, Kana-chan.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:59.170
2980 Yen...

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:00.040
What?

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.610
Hey, Kana-chan.

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:18.370
Can you do me a favor

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:22.320
and buy two notebooks on the way home from school tomorrow?

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:24.700
Sure, two notebooks, right?

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:28.070
Great, here's the money.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:31.450
Oh, you can keep the change.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.570
Yume-san, no.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:37.790
Each grain of money is the fruit of the hard labor the farmers put into it and-

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.310
I think you're thinking about rice.

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:40.250
Huh?

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:46.570
A-Anyway, it means that you have to cherish the money you have!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:52.370
Oh no, I have to prepare the rice for dinner!

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:55.500
Damn, it didn't work.

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:58.470
What happened?

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:01.310
Oh, it's just that...

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:08.030
Here Yume, two notebooks...

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.670
Our hearts connect us.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:13.620
We're going to have dinner soon.

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:16.130
That's basically it.

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:17.440
I see.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:20.520
I'd totally accept any and every gift.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.970
She's not like you!

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:26.470
What? Chief, you'd do the same, right?

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:29.930
Of course! I mean there is even that saying:

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:35.800
"What's yours is mine, what's mine is mine."

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.260
No, there isn't.

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:45.060
So I guess we need a way to invalidate any excuse and force her to accept it.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:45.870
Yeah.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:49.130
Oh, I have an idea!

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:52.580
I think this might work.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.990
Let's hear it.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.410
<b>Then...</b>

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:02.800
Kana, can you hand me the soy sauce?

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:05.190
Sure, here you go Chief!

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:06.210
Thanks.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:11.080
Excuse me, Kana-san.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:15.180
Could you give me about 50 of those flyers?

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.020
Sure thing!

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:25.010
Kana, have you see my route plan?

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:27.430
Your route plan?

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:29.910
Oh, it's over there.

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:31.340
Oh, it is!

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:35.150
Kana-chan, can you try my cake?

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.440
Sure.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.770
Kana-san?

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:42.420
Kana, do you have a sec?

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:43.690
Kana-chan.

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:44.700
Hey Kana.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:47.920
Kana-chan, verbally abuse me!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.990
Shut up you @#meow&%^!

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:58.370
Shine shine

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:55.680
How did you make me say that?!

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:57.900
That's not bad either.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.850
Hey, Kana-chan?

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.320
Yes?

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:05.040
Hey, Kana.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.720
Coming!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.130
Kana, where are you?!

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:11.020
Coming!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.060
Excuse me...

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:12.660
Sure!

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:13.760
Kana-chan!

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:14.490
Yes!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:24.450
Hey Kana, where's Johnny's friend Michael?

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:28.030
He had an unfortunate accident...

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:30.850
Damn you Johnny!

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:32.690
Screech! Crash!

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:38.600
Good work everybody. I'm handing out this month's pay now.

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.180
Yay!

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.960
All right, I'm off to school.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:52.270
Um Chief, I have an extra pay envelope...

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:57.240
It's a special bonus because you've been doing a lot of extra menial labor.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.290
Okay.

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:10.510
So there are 40 one Yen coins, 4 ten Yen coins, and as for the 100 Yen coins...

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:13.870
What should I do?

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:20.290
All in all I have... 2980 Yen!

00:20:02.130 --> 00:22:26.700
And the first...

00:20:02.130 --> 00:22:26.700
<b>Fuushin
Gazette</b>

00:20:02.130 --> 00:22:26.700
<b>On your doorstep daily</b>

00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:34.720
Grandma, I want to become someone who can repay everybody's kindness.

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:39.090
And I am sure there will be many "firsts" from now on out.

00:22:39.090 --> 00:22:42.070
We might also get new people.

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:45.200
I hope that I will be able to give them

00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:50.050
a lot of "firsts" like everyone has done for me.

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:53.230
Many wonderful "firsts"...

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:57.770
And everybody now!

00:23:01.590 --> 00:23:04.980
Welcome to the Fuushin Gazette!

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:21.520
Damn you Johnny! I will definitely get you next time.

00:23:21.520 --> 00:23:23.300
But this was the last episode!

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:24.040
What?

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:29.950
Good night.

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:35.140
<b>Thank you!</b>

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:35.140
<b>Kanamemo</b>

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:35.140
Illustration - Shouko Iwami
